    <tags>teal-vpn vpn privacy wifi security admin</tags>
    <summary>Private VPN for Windows 10 and 11 with a free plan of 500 MB a day, no ads and no browsing logs.</summary>
    <description>Teal VPN is a private VPN for Windows 10 and 11 (Intel, AMD and ARM). It encrypts your connection on hotel, cafe, office and airport Wi-Fi and is made for networks that block or detect VPN traffic: the connection is obfuscated and the app tries another route by itself when one stalls.

Teal Free is included with every account: 500 MB of data a day, up to 2 devices, no payment details and no ads. Teal Pro adds unlimited data, every location and up to 3 devices. Sign in with Google, Apple or email; the same account works on Android, Mac and Linux.

This package downloads the signed installer from the GitHub release of the same version (SHA-256 pinned) and runs it silently. Uninstall removes the app, the service and the driver.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/tealvpn/windows/releases/tag/v0.1.30</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
